_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_

**`react-native-web-vite/expo-ts` loses Vite 8 resolution due to overwrite.**

The assignment on line 118 overwrites (rather than merges) `additionalResolutions`, so `react-native-web-vite/expo-ts` loses the Vite 8 beta resolution set at line 105–107. This sandbox matches both `isViteSandbox()` (contains `'vite'`) and the React 19 list.


<details>
<summary>🐛 Proposed fix: merge resolutions instead of overwriting</summary>

```diff
   if (
     [
       'nextjs/default-ts',
       'nextjs/prerelease',
       'react-native-web-vite/expo-ts',
     ].includes(key)
   ) {
     additionalResolutions = {
+      ...additionalResolutions,
       react: '^19.0.0',
       'react-dom': '^19.0.0',
     };
   } else if (key === 'react-webpack/prerelease-ts') {
     additionalResolutions = {
+      ...additionalResolutions,
       react: packageJson.dependencies.react,
       'react-dom': packageJson.dependencies['react-dom'],
     };
   } else if (key === 'react-rsbuild/default-ts') {
     additionalResolutions = {
+      ...additionalResolutions,
       'react-docgen': '^8.0.2',
     };
   }
```
</details>

